@page rh="THE PARISH HOUSEHOLD · EDEN · CONTRADICTION" m="TKC: TR · CR; WRITING"
# The contradiction
note: Violence during Endurance.
rec:
What she believes and breaks | INFERENCE: How you treat people who can't help you is the truest thing about you (TR). On Endurance Day 3, with Delphine, she knocks Maren unconscious and leaves her in Mountain terrain (TR).
CONFLICT | The fates table has Delphine extracted with a head injury on Day 1 and helping on Day 3 (TR). One of the two has to move.
What she wants and uses | She wants to be the woman the city pauses for, and to use the pause (CR). The pause runs through the Empire's own machinery.
